<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>steady. Trading very active. Demand good. Top $57.50 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   57.00-57.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   56.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.50 lower, 450-600 lbs steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    46.50</p>
<p>	    450-600 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
</text>
